    "reason": "This sub-experiment characterizes shifts in media PZC and cation adsorption under field conditions rather than directly measuring PFAS removal; endpoints and denominators differ from typical treatment performance metrics, so records are primarily mechanistic and not directly comparable to standard removal data.",
